# --- v1 of the Isaac Sim / GR00T G1 adapter: an intermediate, not a deliverable ---
# `cbd_adapter_groot_g1.py` writes 06_groot_g1/ from canonical CBD, and the v2
# stages read it from there -- `robot_stage.py --motion` and `finalize.py --v1`
# both default to it. It is regenerated by re-running stage 1, so only v2's
# output is committed; what v1 produced survives as measurements inside
# 07_groot_g1_v2/ (`change_from_v1_deg`, `joint_angles_v1_rad`).
examples/human-capture/sample_output/06_groot_g1/

